{"version":1,"content":"<p>俄羅斯衛星通訊社報道，俄羅斯總統助理烏沙科夫（Yuri Ushakov）昨（25日）表示，中國國家主席習近平、俄羅斯總統普京及美國總統特朗普在深圳APEC峰會期間舉行三方會談的組織和籌備工作已啟動，並稱中方對舉行會談的「態度非常認真」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:00:46.138751+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:08:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:18.659590+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:58:06.357187+00:00","content_hash":"4a0235e7ecbbe7dd45a1d4af5a8148853bfcbfd9955badc7145a89cb17c3686a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}